<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="2eb4a9d1">&lt;p&gt;
    This example provides common industry reference models and illustrates how to customize the reference models to suit
    specific needs. Two common Open Group reference models used within industry are the:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;Technical Reference Model (TRM)&lt;/strong&gt; - enables a structured definition of the standardized application
        platform space and the associated interfaces. The coarsest breakdown of the TRM contains three major entities
        (application software, application platform and communications infrastructure) connected by two interfaces
        (application platform interface and communications infrastructure interface).
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;Detailed view of TRM&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;./../../../core.gen.common.base/guidances/examples/./resources/TOGAF TRM High Level.png&quot; width=&quot;500&quot; height=&quot;502&quot; /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;High level view of TRM&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;img alt=&quot;Technical Reference Model&quot; src=&quot;./../../../core.gen.common.base/guidances/examples/./resources/TOGAF Technical Reference Model.png&quot; width=&quot;500&quot;
    height=&quot;519&quot; /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;Integrated Information Infrastructure Reference Model (III-RM)&lt;/strong&gt; - focuses on highly reusable
        application software space and common systems architecture solutions used across a wide number of relevant domains.
        Examples of common system architectures include security architecture, management architecture, network
        architecture and operations architecture.
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;High level view of III-RM&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;./../../../core.gen.common.base/guidances/examples/./resources/TOGAF IIIRM High Level.png&quot; width=&quot;595&quot; height=&quot;415&quot; /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;Detailed view of III-RM&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;./../../../core.gen.common.base/guidances/examples/./resources/TOGAF IIIRM Detailed.png&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; height=&quot;453&quot; /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
